@startuml

skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
    ParticipantBorderColor #888888
    ArrowColor #444444
    LifeLineBorderColor #888888
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
    FontColor #222222
}
skinparam shadowing false

title Chatbot System - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant Chatbot
participant Backend
participant IntentHandler
participant GoogleCalendar
participant OpenAIIntegration
participant UserContext
participant ErrorHandler

== User initiates interaction ==
User -> Chatbot: startSession()
User -> Chatbot: sendMessage(input)
Chatbot -> UserContext: getContext(userId)
UserContext --> Chatbot: contextData
Chatbot -> Backend: processMessage(input, contextData)

== Intent classification ==
Backend -> Backend: loadResources()
Backend -> Backend: classifyIntent(input)
Backend --> Chatbot: intentType

== Marketing Intent Handling ==
Chatbot -> Backend: processMarketingIntent(intentType, input)
Backend -> IntentHandler: handleIntent(intentType, input)
IntentHandler -> IntentHandler: generateMarketingTips()
IntentHandler -> UserContext: updateContext(userId, data)
UserContext --> IntentHandler: updatedContext
IntentHandler -> Backend: logInteraction(data)
IntentHandler --> Backend: marketingTips
Backend --> Chatbot: response

== Calendar Intent Handling ==
Chatbot -> Backend: processCalendarIntent(intentType, input)
Backend -> GoogleCalendar: authenticate()
GoogleCalendar --> Backend: authStatus
Backend -> GoogleCalendar: createEvent(eventDetails)
GoogleCalendar --> Backend: eventConfirmation
Backend -> UserContext: updateContext(userId, data)
UserContext --> Backend: updatedContext
Backend --> Chatbot: response

== Fallback Intent Handling ==
Chatbot -> Backend: processFallbackIntent(intentType, input)
Backend -> OpenAIIntegration: queryAPI(input)
OpenAIIntegration --> Backend: fallbackResponse
Backend -> UserContext: updateContext(userId, data)
UserContext --> Backend: updatedContext
Backend --> Chatbot: response

== Error Handling ==
Chatbot -> Backend: processError(input)
Backend -> ErrorHandler: detectError(input)
ErrorHandler -> ErrorHandler: classifyError(error)
ErrorHandler -> ErrorHandler: recover(error)
ErrorHandler --> Backend: errorResponse
Backend --> Chatbot: errorResponse

== Response delivery ==
Chatbot -> User: displayResponse(response)

@enduml 